      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINTER KEY (1) has a strong overall record having four wins and eight places from 14 starts including a last start success (24.60) over 440m at this track. Has never been out of the money in five starts this course. Drawn the rails and rates a key runner. MISS GLAMOURPUSS (8) is a promising type who notched her 11th career success when too good (24.76) at this track last time. Form at the trip excellent including 10 wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Sure to be thereabouts. BIG FROST (2) shapes as hard to beat after winning last start over the 440m at this track in a useful 24.86. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. SUMMER ANGEL (4) will be hard to beat with a drop in trip.",
